BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 3466 Tm (to reach you. Write what happened and press Send: the report goes to the project with the error and the logs of) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 3554 Tm (its run, carrying no location data and no photographs. Save only writes it as a zip instead. Only when sending is) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 3642 Tm (not open yet, or a send fails, does the window say so and suggest sending the saved zip by opening an issue at) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 3730 Tm (<https://github.com/oRAirwolf/grouplab/issues> or by email to support@grouplab.org, with a line about what you) Tj ET
