BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 3941 Tm (GroupLab keeps everything in %APPDATA%\\GroupLab on Windows, and under your home folder on macOS) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 4029 Tm (and Linux: settings, your sessions database, any sheet you design, and the log. To remove it, uninstall or delete) Tj ET
